Superblock v3.2.0
-----------------

- New features:
  - Added setting page for the addon.
  - Option to block or not reshares of posts by blocked authors.
  - Option to drop incoming activities from blocked authors.

Superblock v3.1.2
-----------------

- Fixes:
  - Fix hubzilla/addons#170 - Superblocked users produce empty $content entries in notifications
  - Fix hubzilla/addons#190 - Superblocked non-connections pile up in notifications

Superblock v3.1.1
-----------------

- Fixes:
  - Crash in filterEnotifyFormat when hash is missing from hook args.

Superblock v3.1.0
-----------------

- New features:
  - Added an optional expiry time when blocking a channel, allowing temporarily blocking a channel for a specific duration.
  - It is now possible to edit channel blocks from the superblock addon app page.

- Fixes:
  - Blocking a channel already blocked will now update the original channel block instead of adding another entry.

- Misc:
  - Further refactoring and clean up in the code
  - Made addon app page more consistent with other Hubzilla pages.
  - Addon module now only reponds to well defined paths.
